\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\sl480\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid3031034 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs24\insrsid9006828\charrsid10317989 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
2.2 Online Hostel Allocation System
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid9006828\charrsid10317989 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 An Online Hostel Allocation System (OHAS) is a computer-based system designed to \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
automate the process of assigning hostel rooms to students. It provides a platform where students can apply for accommodation online, check room availability, and receive allocation results without physically visiting the hostel office.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 The system typicall\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 y includes:
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Student Module: Allows students to register, submit hostel requests, and track their application status.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Admin Module: Enables hostel administrators to approve applications, manage room availability, and generate reports.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 By automating the proc\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
ess, OHAS improves efficiency, reduces errors, and ensures transparency. Students can access the system at any time, and administrators can easily maintain records and monitor occupancy.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs24\insrsid9006828\charrsid10317989 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 2.3 Benefits of an Online Hostel Allocation System
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid9006828\charrsid10317989 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Implementing an OH\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 AS provides several key benefits:
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 - Time Efficiency: Students no longer need to wait in long queues. They can submit applications and receive updates online.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 - Error Reduction: Automated systems reduce mistakes in room assignments and record-keeping.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 - Tra\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 nsparency: Students can see the status of their applications, reducing complaints about unfair allocation.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 - Better Record-Keeping: Administrators can generate reports, track student information, and monitor hostel occupancy digitally.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 - Accessibility: Stu\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 dents and administrators can access the system from anywhere using a computer or mobile device.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 - Improved Student Experience: Simplifying the hostel application process reduces stress and enhances overall satisfaction.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 For instance, collages that have ado\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 pted online allocation systems have reported fewer errors, quicker processing times, and higher levels of student satisfaction compared to manual systems.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs24\insrsid9006828\charrsid10317989 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 2.4 Components of an Online Hostel Allocation System
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid9006828\charrsid10317989 \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 An effective OHAS typically includes the followi\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 ng components:
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Database: Stores student information, room details, and allocation records. A relational database such as MySQL is often used.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 User Interface (UI): The part of the system that students and administrators interact with. It should be simple, c\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 lear, and user-friendly.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Allocation Algorithm: Determines which student is assigned to which room based on availability and any defined rules.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Notification System: Alerts students when their applications have been processed and allocations completed.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 These\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0  components work together to ensure smooth, efficient, and transparent hostel allocation.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid13201751\charrsid10317989 
