a management, which enhances data consistency and reporting capability. Administrators can generate occupancy reports, track student accommodation history, and monitor hostel utilization rates.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 Despite these advantages, integrated systems are often complex\hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 
 and expensive to implement. They require strong ICT infrastructure and technical expertise for maintenance. Smaller institutions may find such systems financially or technically demanding.
