\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 - User Training: Both students and administrators need to understand how to use the system effectively.
\par \hich\af0\dbch\af13\loch\f0 - Maintenance: Regular updates are necessary to keep the system running smoothly and fix any bugs.
